From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tom <tompt@seznam.cz>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:18:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: apple: allow the AOP sensor mounting matrix

J120 describes the gyroscope mounting orientation for the IIO driver. Accept mount-matrix on the motion service nodes as for the accelerometer.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,aop.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,aop.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,aop.yaml
index 89ab88843..6e5632498 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,aop.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,aop.yaml
@@ -92,6 +92,7 @@ patternProperties:
           - apple,t8010-aop-gyro
           - apple,t8010-aop-compass
           - apple,t8010-aop-pressure
+      mount-matrix: true
       status: true
     required:
       - compatible
